{"id":"jenseits","lemma":"jenseits","pos":"prep","rank":2527,"glosses":["beyond, on the other side of"],"ipa":"/ˈjeːnzaɪ̯t͡s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/78/De-jenseits.ogg/De-jenseits.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Jenseits des Berges liegt ein Dorf.","en":"There is a village over the mountain.","words":[null,{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"a mountain, hill","l":"Berg"},{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"village"}]},{"text":"Der Fluss liegt jenseits des Hügels.","en":"The river's on the other side of the hill.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"river"},{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},null,{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"hill","l":"Hügel"}]},{"text":"Das ist jenseits der Vernunft.","en":"It's beyond reason.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"reason, good sense"}]},{"text":"Gleich jenseits des Waldes lag ein schöner See.","en":"A beautiful lake lay just beyond the forest.","words":[{"g":"alike"},null,{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"forest","l":"Wald"},{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"well, beautifully","l":"schön"},{"g":"sea, ocean"}]},{"text":"Tom ist jenseits jeden Verdachts.","en":"Tom is above suspicion.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"each","l":"jeder"},{"g":"suspicion","l":"Verdacht"}]}]}